---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHead from "../../components/PageHead.astro";
import CtaBand from "../../components/CtaBand.astro";
import IntegrationGrid from "../../components/IntegrationGrid.astro";
import Faq from "../../components/Faq.astro";
import Roadmap from "../../components/Roadmap";
import Icon from "../../components/Icon.astro";

const faq = [
  { q: "Does an AI write my recommendations?", a: "No. The action, reasons and unknowns come from fixed rules that look at your data. An AI model only rewrites those conclusions in plain language, and every sentence is checked against the engine output before you see it. If the AI service is unavailable or its text fails the check, you still get the full recommendation." },
  { q: "What if my data is incomplete or messy?", a: "That is expected. 7Captur works with what you give it, flags what is missing or does not line up, and tells you which single input would improve the next decision most." },
  { q: "What does an evidence label mean?", a: "It tells you where a number came from: entered by you, imported from a file, extracted from a screenshot (and confirmed by you), connected directly, estimated, or unknown. We never present an estimate as a measured fact." },
  { q: "Can 7Captur tell me which post made a sale?", a: "Only when the link is recorded. If you tell us an order came from a post, it is shown as reported by you. If the source is unknown, the sale still counts in your business totals but is not credited to a post." },
];
---
<Layout
  title="Platform | 7Captur"
  description="Set a goal, add the data you have, get an evidence-based recommendation, choose whether to act, and learn from the result. No website required."
  path="/platform/" current="/platform/">
<main>
<PageHead wide title="From the data you have to a clear next step." lede="Setup takes a few minutes. You do not need a website, a store or an ad account. Add more later and the guidance gets sharper." />

<section class="section section-flush" style="padding-bottom:72px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <h2>Five steps. You set the pace.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Tap a step to see what happens there. On a phone, swipe through them like cards.</p>
    </div>
    <Roadmap client:visible />
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Honest by design</p>
    <h2>The advice matches your evidence.</h2>
    <p class="lede">The same engine runs on every plan. It picks its mode from the data in front of it, not from what you pay.</p>
    <div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Evidence modes">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Mode</th><th>When</th><th>What it can suggest</th><th>What it will not claim</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Explore</td><td>Mostly views, reach and engagement</td><td>A small test, comparing content, recording enquiries</td><td>Return, profit or that a post caused sales</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Improve</td><td>Some enquiries or orders, plus spend</td><td>Comparing cost per enquiry or order, improving follow-up</td><td>Profitability without costs</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Optimize</td><td>Reliable spend, revenue, refunds and costs over comparable periods</td><td>Return after declared costs, cautious budget suggestions for you to consider</td><td>Guaranteed future results</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="fine">Missing costs are treated as unknown, never as zero. Records in different currencies are not mixed.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="engine" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <h2>Rules decide. AI explains.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Your recommendation is built by fixed rules, not by a chatbot guessing. An AI model then puts it in plain words, and the result is checked before you see it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="pipe" data-reveal>
      <li><span class="tile"><Icon name="posts" size={24} /></span><b>Your records</b><span>Posts, promotions, enquiries, sales and costs, each labelled by source.</span><em class="who">You</em></li>
      <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></li>
      <li><span class="tile"><Icon name="understand" size={24} /></span><b>Checks</b><span>Currency, gaps and mismatches are checked. Missing costs stay unknown.</span><em class="who">7Captur rules</em></li>
      <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></li>
      <li><span class="tile"><Icon name="decide" size={24} /></span><b>Recommendation</b><span>An evidence mode is chosen. The action, reasons, unknowns and next measurement are written.</span><em class="who">7Captur rules</em></li>
      <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></li>
      <li class="ai"><span class="tile"><Icon name="leads" size={24} /></span><b>Plain wording</b><span>An AI model rewrites those conclusions as a short, friendly summary. It receives the conclusions only, not your raw records or notes.</span><em class="who">AI model</em></li>
      <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></li>
      <li><span class="tile"><Icon name="coins" size={24} /></span><b>Safety check</b><span>Every number must trace back to the engine. Promises, links and unsupported profit claims are rejected.</span><em class="who">7Captur rules</em></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="facts" style="margin-top:40px" data-reveal>
      <div class="fact"><h3>The AI never makes the decision</h3><p>The action and the reasons come from rules you can read about on this page. The AI only rewrites them.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><h3>Checked before you see it</h3><p>If the wording adds a number the engine did not produce, or promises a result, it is thrown away.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><h3>Works without AI</h3><p>If the AI service is unavailable or its wording fails the check, you still get the complete recommendation.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><h3>Screenshots: AI reads, you confirm</h3><p>When you upload a screenshot, an AI model reads the values. Nothing is saved until you have reviewed and confirmed them.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="fine">Text is processed by a third-party AI provider. See the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> for how your data is handled.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="platforms" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Connections and imports</p>
    <h2>Direct where it exists. Import or manual everywhere else.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Direct connections are read-only and use each platform's own login. You can disconnect at any time and keep working with imports and manual entry.</p>
    <IntegrationGrid />
    <p class="fine">Need another platform? <a href="/contact/">Tell us which one</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Questions</p>
    <h2>How it behaves with real data.</h2>
    <Faq items={faq} />
  </div>
</section>

<CtaBand title="Try it with the data you already have." text="Add a few posts, a promotion and your enquiries to get your first recommendation." />
</main>
</Layout>
